	(text "+3V3_AUX: always-on supply for the PD controller (needs about 5 mA).\nInput and output capacitors: 10 uF X5R/X7R, within 5 mm of the regulator pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e53a77f4-c578-4b48-bcb5-7cac4e833333")
	)
	(text "+3V3: MCU, flash, microSD, indicators, connector 3.3 V pins.\nTHERMAL LIMIT: 1.7 V x load current is dissipated here (SOT-23-5, 184 C/W in the datasheet).\nAt 40 C ambient that allows about 350 mA unless the pad is tied to a large copper area.\nBudget: MCU about 100 mA, flash 20 mA, microSD up to 100 mA, connector loads on top."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e6187cd7-4fe0-47db-aba5-f1e8b7c45c61")
	)
